      "review_summary": "The PR bridges Slack presentation capabilities and renderPresentation through the Slack channel outbound facade, reorders outbound receipt classification to prefer rich payloads over text, and adds Slack/outbound-bridge regression tests.\n\nPR surface: Source +30, Tests +88. Total +118 across 4 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. at source level. Current main's Slack facade lacks the presentation fields core reads, and current receipt inference checks text before presentation for text-plus-presentation payloads; I did not run a live Slack workspace reproduction.",
